{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "progress",
	"title": "Progress 进度条",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "显示任务的完成进度。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"bits-ui@2.20.0",
		"@internationalized/date@^3.12.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"进度条",
				"progress",
				"进度",
				"完成度",
				"上传进度"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"显示可度量的任务完成度，如上传、导入"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "无法估计进度的等待",
					"use": "spinner"
				},
				{
					"case": "内容加载占位",
					"use": "skeleton"
				},
				{
					"case": "用户调整数值",
					"use": "slider"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"用 Field 提供标签或加 aria-label，让进度条有名称",
				"完成度要能用文字读到，如“已上传 60%”"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"占满容器宽度"
			],
			"related": [
				"spinner",
				"skeleton",
				"slider"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Progress 设计规范\n\n- 用于可以计算进度的任务（上传、导入）；无法估计进度时用 Spinner。\n- 用 `value` 和 `max` 表达进度，进度条必须有名称：传 `aria-label`，或用 `aria-labelledby` 指向旁边的说明文字。\n- 旁边用文字显示百分比或“3／10”等具体进度，不要只靠条的长度。\n- 高度和圆角跟随组件样式，不要用 `class` 改。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "progress/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./progress.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Progress,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "progress/index.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Progress as ProgressPrimitive } from \"bits-ui\";\n\timport { cn, type WithoutChildrenOrChild } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tmax = 100,\n\t\tvalue,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildrenOrChild<ProgressPrimitive.RootProps> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<ProgressPrimitive.Root\n\tbind:ref\n\tdata-slot=\"progress\"\n\tclass={cn(\"bg-muted h-3 rounded-full relative flex w-full items-center overflow-x-hidden\", className)}\n\t{value}\n\t{max}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t<div\n\t\tdata-slot=\"progress-indicator\"\n\t\tclass=\"bg-primary size-full flex-1 transition-all\"\n\t\tstyle=\"transform: translateX(-{100 - (100 * (value ?? 0)) / (max ?? 1)}%)\"\n\t></div>\n</ProgressPrimitive.Root>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "progress/progress.svelte"
		}
	]
}